      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../ReactiveStreamCommands.TrimCommand.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>ReactiveStreamCommands.TrimCommand</code></a> given a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>key</code></a> and <a href=\"../RedisStreamCommands.XTrimOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStreamCommands.XTrimOptions</code></a>.",
