    {
      "source": "since 4.0: specify a concrete trim strategy (MAXLEN or MINID) via <a href=\"../RedisStreamCommands.XTrimOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStreamCommands.XTrimOptions</code></a>\nand <a href=\"../RedisStreamCommands.TrimOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStreamCommands.TrimOptions</code></a> instead of using this method.",
      "translation": "自 4.0 版本起：请通过<a href=\"../RedisStreamCommands.XTrimOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStreamCommands.XTrimOptions</code></a>和<a href=\"../RedisStreamCommands.TrimOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStreamCommands.TrimOptions</code></a>指定具体的修剪策略（MAXLEN 或 MINID），而不是使用此方法。",
